# Queue all inputs before a fast run advances; each semicolon has its own reply.
@f300 send u051a Activate; place u051a player 8
@f350 fsm u051a Lurk
@f450 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f480 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f510 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f540 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f570 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f600 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f630 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f660 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f690 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f720 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f750 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f780 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f810 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f840 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f870 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f900 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f930 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f960 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f990 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f1020 codecall u051a DeactivateCloak; damage u051a 1
@f1100 obj u051a; status
